#* '''2015''', Lawrence A. Pervin, [https://books.google.com/books?id=lIXwCQAAQBAJ&pg=PA131&dq=%22most+uppermost%22&hl=en&sa=X&ved=0ahUKEwiXn5eY1trOAhUDxWMKHbA4ATY4FBDoAQg1MAU#v=onepage&q=%22most%20uppermost%22&f=false Goal Concepts in Personality and Social Psychology]
